{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31733","headline":"客喜 · 贾岛","name":"客喜","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"客喜非实喜，客悲非实悲。\n百回信到家，未当身一归。\n未归长嗟愁，嗟愁填中怀。\n开口吐愁声，还却入耳来。\n常恐泪滴多，自损两目辉。\n鬓边虽有丝，不堪织寒衣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贾岛","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31733.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31733","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}